<designInfo studyType="ResponseSurface" studySubType="Randomized" designType="Dummy" noOfRuns="125" noOfFactors="3" noOfResponses="1" noOfAnalyses="1">
<designNotes>NESO-based calculated scenarios, not measured experiments. Source GBP price year unconfirmed. Yearly use 50%; finance rate 8%; life 25 years; fixed OPEX 2.75% of CAPEX; water/replacement allowance 0.12261507874015748 GBP/kg. Bounds span NESO 2025-2050 projections. Crossed designs are hypothetical. Imported through Excel at six decimal places. Six model terms follow the known cost equation. No experimental significance claim. Unit labels and this note were added to the native XML after the analysis; data and fitted coefficients were unchanged.</designNotes>
</designInfo>
